  1 · THE LADDER — exceedance over the bin count, and its two halves
===================================================================================================
    ⛔ 'exceed' means truth > the MAXIMUM outcome that cell's bin observed in the fit
      window. `zero` = the bin saw only zeros (the method forecast nothing); `tail` = the
      bin saw events and this one is bigger than all of them. Only `tail` is M67's
      'unprecedented event'.

